    "kk_fws_tap_warning": {
      "type": "kk-fws-tap-warning",
      "blocks": {
        "paragraph_intro": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every year, millions of Americans fall sick by ingesting harmful chemicals through tap water. In Baltimore, they recently detected a parasite in the drinking water… in California’s Coachella Valley, they found water from fast-food soda fountains contained salmonella… and in Iowa, they identified unsafe amounts of nitrate and alachlor.</p>"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_effects": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>These chemicals have been linked to a range of dangerous side effects - liver and kidney damage, thyroid disease, cancer and even “blue baby syndrome” in infants. Phoenix Gravity Water Filters use a powerful Nano Toxin filter technology to remove 99.9% of contaminants from tap water, making it safe to drink in any city in America!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "paragraph_intro",
        "paragraph_effects"
      ],
      "settings": {
